{"seq":3,"slug":"auto-instrumentation-otel-sdk","title":"自动埋点与 OpenTelemetry SDK 接入实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/observability-tracing-telemetry-platform/tracing-instrumentation-propagation/auto-instrumentation-otel-sdk","wordCount":2191,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"自动埋点与-opentelemetry-sdk-接入实操\">自动埋点与 OpenTelemetry SDK 接入实操</h1><p>一个跨境电商订单服务由 14 个微服务组成，横跨 Java 的结算核心、Python 的风控评分、Node.js 的 BFF。如果让每个团队各自改代码加 Span，第一周能覆盖 3 个服务，第二周就停滞——因为没人愿意为可观测性动业务逻辑，也没人敢在生产里改动经过风控审计的代码路径。自动埋点（zero-code instrumentation）解决的就是这个僵局：<strong>不改业务源码，通过字节码改写、运行时猴子补丁或内核探针，把 OpenTelemetry 调用注入到框架和库的既有调用点上</strong>。本文讲清楚这件事在三类运行时的真实接法、Kubernetes 上的注入方式，以及上线后最常见的踩坑点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-自动埋点靠什么生效\">核心概念：自动埋点靠什么生效</h2><p>零代码埋点不是&quot;魔法&quot;，它的原理只有三条路径，选哪条由语言的运行时特性决定（<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/concepts/instrumentation/zero-code/\">OpenTelemetry 零代码埋点</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>代表语言</th>\n<th>工作原理</th>\n<th>覆盖范围</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>字节码操作</td>\n<td>Java、.NET</td>\n<td>JVM 启动时加载 agent jar，改写已加载类的字节码</td>\n<td>库与框架（HTTP、DB、MQ）</td>\n<td>启动变慢、需 JVM 参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>猴子补丁</td>\n<td>Python、Node.js</td>\n<td>运行时替换库函数引用</td>\n<td>库与框架</td>\n<td>依赖库的导入顺序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>eBPF 探针</td>\n<td>Go、C 系</td>\n<td>内核态挂探针，抓取系统调用与网络事件</td>\n<td>进程级，无需链接符号</td>\n<td>需特权、无应用层语义</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一条边界必须讲清楚：<strong>自动埋点覆盖的是&quot;库调用&quot;，不是&quot;你的业务逻辑&quot;</strong>。它能自动给一次 HTTP 出站、一次 Redis 取值生成 Span，但无法知道&quot;这段代码是在做优惠券校验&quot;。业务语义需要显式 API 补充，这正是后面&quot;自动 + 手动混合&quot;要处理的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[应用进程启动] --&gt; B{运行时类型}&#10;    B --&gt;|JVM| C[&quot;-javaagent 加载&lt;br/&gt;改写已加载类字节码&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|Python/Node| D[预加载模块&lt;br/&gt;运行时替换库函数]&#10;    B --&gt;|Go/编译型| E[eBPF 内核探针&lt;br/&gt;挂载 uprobe/tracepoint]&#10;    C --&gt; F[生成 Span]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[OTLP 导出&lt;br/&gt;经 Collector]&#10;    G --&gt; H{是否需要业务语义?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[手动 API 补充属性与事件]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J[直接入库]\">graph TD\n    A[应用进程启动] --&gt; B{运行时类型}\n    B --&gt;|JVM| C[\"-javaagent 加载&lt;br/&gt;改写已加载类字节码\"]\n    B --&gt;|Python/Node| D[预加载模块&lt;br/&gt;运行时替换库函数]\n    B --&gt;|Go/编译型| E[eBPF 内核探针&lt;br/&gt;挂载 uprobe/tracepoint]\n    C --&gt; F[生成 Span]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[OTLP 导出&lt;br/&gt;经 Collector]\n    G --&gt; H{是否需要业务语义?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[手动 API 补充属性与事件]\n    H --&gt;|否| J[直接入库]</pre><h2 id=\"java-agent-jar-与-javaagent-接入\">Java：agent jar 与 -javaagent 接入</h2><p>Java 是自动化成熟度最高的一条线。接入只需一次下载加一个 JVM 参数，agent 会在启动时动态注入字节码，覆盖 Java 8+ 应用（<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/zero-code/java/agent/getting-started/\">Java Agent 快速上手</a>）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"shell\" data-code=\"curl -L -o opentelemetry-javaagent.jar \\&#10;  https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/releases/latest/download/opentelemetry-javaagent.jar&#10;&#10;java -javaagent:path/to/opentelemetry-javaagent.jar \\&#10;     -Dotel.service.name=order-settlement \\&#10;     -jar myapp.jar\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -L</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> opentelemetry-javaagent.jar</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/releases/latest/download/opentelemetry-javaagent.jar</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">java</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -javaagent:path/to/opentelemetry-javaagent.jar</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">     -Dotel.service.name=order-settlement</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">     -jar</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp.jar</span></span></code></pre></div><p>agent 2.x 起默认协议已从 gRPC 改为 <strong>http/protobuf，默认端口 4318</strong>（<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/languages/java/configuration/\">Java 配置</a>）——如果你沿用旧的 4317 gRPC 端点，必须显式改回，否则导出会静默失败到&quot;连不上 Collector&quot;的假象。</p>\n<p>agent 专属的控制开关不多，但每个都影响排查效率：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环境变量</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>使用注意</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>OTEL_JAVAAGENT_CONFIGURATION_FILE</code></td>\n<td>指定 properties 配置文件</td>\n<td>比一长串 <code>-D</code> 更易维护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OTEL_JAVAAGENT_EXTENSIONS</code></td>\n<td>加载扩展 jar 或目录</td>\n<td>自研插桩的挂载点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OTEL_JAVAAGENT_LOGGING</code></td>\n<td><code>simple</code>（默认）/<code>none</code>/<code>application</code></td>\n<td><code>none</code> 会连报错都吞掉，仅用于压测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OTEL_JAVAAGENT_DEBUG</code></td>\n<td>打开 debug 日志</td>\n<td>输出极其啰嗦，只临时开</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在 K8s 里更推荐用 <strong>声明式配置</strong>（<code>otel.experimental.config.file</code> / <code>OTEL_EXPERIMENTAL_CONFIG_FILE</code>）代替散落的环境变量。代价是明确的：<strong>一旦使用配置文件，环境变量与系统属性会被整体忽略，程序化定制与 SPI 也一并跳过</strong>——配置文件成为唯一真相源（<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/languages/java/configuration/\">Java 配置</a>）。这个&quot;全有或全无&quot;的语义，是很多团队&quot;改了配置文件却不生效&quot;的根因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"python-与-node-js-预加载式接入\">Python 与 Node.js：预加载式接入</h2><p>Python 的自动埋点建立在猴子补丁上，工具链是 <code>opentelemetry-distro</code> 提供的两个命令（<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/zero-code/python/\">Python 零代码埋点</a>）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"shell\" data-code=\"pip install opentelemetry-distro opentelemetry-exporter-otlp&#10;opentelemetry-bootstrap -a install          # 扫描环境，装匹配的插桩库&#10;opentelemetry-instrument python myapp.py    # 带 agent 启动\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> opentelemetry-distro</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> opentelemetry-exporter-otlp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opentelemetry-bootstrap</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -a</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # 扫描环境，装匹配的插桩库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opentelemetry-instrument</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> python</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp.py</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 带 agent 启动</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>opentelemetry-bootstrap -a install</code> 会检查当前环境已装的包，自动补上对应的插桩库（装了 Flask 就装 Flask 插桩）。好处是零配置，坏处是<strong>依赖漂移</strong>：镜像重建时若某个库新增或升级，插桩集合会随之变化，导致 Trace 结构在两次发布之间悄悄改变。</p>\n<p>Node.js 走的是 <code>--require</code> 预加载，必须让埋点模块先于业务代码加载（<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/zero-code/js/\">Node.js 零代码埋点</a>）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"shell\" data-code=\"npm install @opentelemetry/api @opentelemetry/auto-instrumentations-node&#10;&#10;node --require @opentelemetry/auto-instrumentations-node/register app.js&#10;# 或写进环境变量，业务启动命令不动：&#10;# NODE_OPTIONS=&quot;--require @opentelemetry/auto-instrumentations-node/register&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @opentelemetry/api</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @opentelemetry/auto-instrumentations-node</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">node</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --require</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @opentelemetry/auto-instrumentations-node/register</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或写进环境变量，业务启动命令不动：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># NODE_OPTIONS=\"--require @opentelemetry/auto-instrumentations-node/register\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>NODE_OPTIONS</code> 的写法在跨境电商场景里格外有用：合规团队往往要求业务启动命令冻结，此时通过环境变量注入预加载，既拿到 Trace 又不动部署脚本。顺序仍然是硬约束——<strong>如果业务代码在埋点模块之前 <code>import</code> 了 <code>http</code> 并缓存了引用，补丁就落在缓存之后，该库的 Span 全部消失</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"kubernetes-上的一键注入-operator-与-instrumentation-crd\">Kubernetes 上的一键注入：Operator 与 Instrumentation CRD</h2><p>当服务数量上到几十个，逐个改启动命令不可维护。OpenTelemetry Operator 用 admission 阶段注入解决这件事：定义一个 <code>Instrumentation</code> 自定义资源（CRD 版本 <code>opentelemetry.io/v1alpha1</code>），再给工作负载打注解（<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/platforms/kubernetes/operator/automatic/\">Operator 自动插桩</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: opentelemetry.io/v1alpha1&#10;kind: Instrumentation&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: crossborder-tracing&#10;spec:&#10;  exporter:&#10;    endpoint: http://otel-collector.observability:4318&#10;  propagators: [tracecontext, baggage]&#10;  sampler:&#10;    type: parentbased_traceidratio&#10;    argument: &#39;0.1&#39;&#10;  python:&#10;    env:&#10;      - name: OTEL_PYTHON_LOG_CORRELATION&#10;        value: &#39;true&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">opentelemetry.io/v1alpha1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Instrumentation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">crossborder-tracing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  exporter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http://otel-collector.observability:4318</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  propagators</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">tracecontext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">baggage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  sampler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">parentbased_traceidratio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    argument</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0.1'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  python</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">OTEL_PYTHON_LOG_CORRELATION</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'true'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>工作负载侧只需一行注解：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"metadata:&#10;  annotations:&#10;    instrumentation.opentelemetry.io/inject-python: &#39;true&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    instrumentation.opentelemetry.io/inject-python</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'true'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注解值可以是 <code>&quot;true&quot;</code>（复用同名 CR）、<code>&lt;CR 名&gt;</code>、<code>&quot;namespace/name&quot;</code> 或 <code>&quot;false&quot;</code>。Operator 收到后新增一个名为 <code>opentelemetry-auto-instrumentation</code> 的 <strong>init container</strong>，把 agent 文件放进共享卷供主容器使用。</p>\n<p>几条硬性规则值得单独列出，它们几乎覆盖了全部现场故障：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>CR 必须先于工作负载创建</strong>，否则注入失败——幂等部署里顺序颠倒就会静默丢失埋点。</li>\n<li><strong>Python/Java 默认 OTLP <code>http/protobuf</code>（4318），Node.js 默认 gRPC（4317）</strong>。注解同一份 CR 给不同语言时，端点协议要按语言分别核对。</li>\n<li><strong>Go 走 eBPF sidecar，不走 init container</strong>：需要 <code>enable-go-instrumentation</code> 特性门（默认 <code>false</code>），并要求 <code>OTEL_GO_AUTO_TARGET_EXE</code> 与特权安全上下文（<code>privileged: true</code>、<code>runAsUser: 0</code>），且<strong>不支持多容器 Pod</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>多容器 Pod</strong> 用 <code>instrumentation.opentelemetry.io/container-names</code> 指定目标容器；一个 Pod 里挂多种语言插桩需要 <code>enable-multi-instrumentation</code> 标志。</li>\n<li><strong>NGINX 与 Go 默认关闭</strong>，别指望&quot;打了注解就有 Span&quot;。</li>\n<li>只想要资源属性而不装 agent，可用 <code>inject-sdk: &quot;true&quot;</code>，它仅注入 <code>OTEL_RESOURCE_ATTRIBUTES</code>、<code>OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT</code> 等变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对于完全编译进二进制、链接符号被裁剪的 Go 服务，还有一条独立路线：<strong>OpenTelemetry eBPF Instrumentation（OBI）</strong>，通过内核探针采集 Trace、指标与服务依赖关系，无需改代码也不依赖符号表，当前版本 <strong>v0.12.1</strong>（v0.12.0 因发布校验失败被 tag 但未发布）（<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/zero-code/obi/\">OBI</a>）。它的取舍是：拿到的是进程/网络层语义，拿不到方法名级的业务 Span。</p>\n<h2 id=\"配置优先级与按库治理\">配置优先级与按库治理</h2><p>自动埋点上线后第一个问题通常是&quot;某个库的 Span 噪音太大&quot;。这里依赖一条通用映射规则：<strong>任何系统属性都能写成环境变量——转大写并把 <code>.</code> 与 <code>-</code> 换成 <code>_</code></strong>。于是 <code>otel.instrumentation.common.default-enabled</code> 对应 <code>OTEL_INSTRUMENTATION_COMMON_DEFAULT_ENABLED</code>，按库开关形如 <code>OTEL_INSTRUMENTATION_&lt;库名&gt;_ENABLED</code>（<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/zero-code/java/agent/configuration/\">Java Agent 配置</a>）。</p>\n<p>配置来源的优先级从高到低为：系统属性 → 环境变量 → 配置文件 → SPI 提供的属性。<strong>系统属性压过环境变量</strong>，这条在 K8s 里极易踩：Operator 注入的环境变量会被镜像里硬编码的 <code>-D</code> 系统属性悄悄覆盖，排查时优先级顺序才是第一现场。</p>\n<p>采样是成本控制的第一个旋钮。默认采样器是 <code>parentbased_always_on</code>——<strong>全量采集</strong>。对跨境电商的结算链路，全量往往意味着每月数万美元的摄取账单。常用值是 <code>parentbased_traceidratio</code> 配比值参数，既保证&quot;父采样则子必采样&quot;的链路完整，又把总量压到目标水位。这里可以做一个容量估算：若峰值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 请求/秒、平均每条 Trace <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 个 Span、单位摄取成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 元/Span，全量月成本约为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>full</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>2.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{full}} \\approx R \\times S \\times c \\times 2.6 \\times 10^{6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">full</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.6\\times10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是一个月的秒数）。要把它压到预算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 以内，采样率的下界是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>full</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r \\ge B / C_{\\text{full}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">full</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。注意这只是下界——真正的采样策略要保证&quot;所有错误 Trace 与慢 Trace 必留&quot;，纯比值采样做不到这一点，最终仍需在 Collector 侧用尾采样补齐。</p>\n<h2 id=\"上线验证-三个必查项\">上线验证：三个必查项</h2><p>自动埋点的失败往往无声。上线后至少验三件事：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Span 是否连成一条链</strong>：在 Trace 界面找一条真实的跨境下单请求，确认从 BFF 到支付路由的 Span 共享同一个 <code>trace-id</code>、父子关系正确；断点通常出现在网关剥离 <code>traceparent</code>（见同章节的 <a href=\"trace-context-propagation\">追踪上下文传播与 W3C TraceContext 模型</a>）或异步消息未注入上下文两处。</li>\n<li><strong><code>service.name</code> 是否可读</strong>：默认值是 <code>unknown_service:java</code> 之类的占位（<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/languages/java/configuration/\">Java 配置</a>）。若服务名未设置，所有服务会挤在同一个名下，拓扑图直接失效。</li>\n<li><strong>资源属性是否随 Pod 正确带出</strong>：<code>OTEL_RESOURCE_ATTRIBUTES</code> 是 <code>key1=val1,key2=val2</code> 格式，由 <code>EnvironmentResourceProvider</code> 解析；云厂商资源探测器（<code>OTEL_RESOURCE_PROVIDERS_AWS_ENABLED</code> 等）默认关闭，需要显式打开才能拿到主机/云区域属性（<a href=\"https://opentelemetry.io/docs/zero-code/java/agent/configuration/\">Java Agent 配置</a>）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>自动埋点把&quot;要不要埋&quot;变成&quot;默认就埋&quot;：Java 靠一次 <code>-javaagent</code>，Python/Node.js 靠预加载模块，K8s 上靠 Operator 的 <code>Instrumentation</code> CRD 与注解在 admission 阶段注入 init container，编译型 Go 服务则由 OBI 的 eBPF 探针兜底。接入本身是几行配置的事，真正的工程投入应当从&quot;写埋点&quot;转向&quot;治理埋点&quot;——按库开关与配置优先级决定采什么，采样策略决定采多少，语义约定版本（当前 1.44.0）决定采出来能否被关联。业务语义缺口仍要靠手动 API 补齐，那是自动埋点唯一无法覆盖、却最值得投入的部分。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自动埋点与 OpenTelemetry SDK 接入实操","id":"自动埋点与-opentelemetry-sdk-接入实操"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：自动埋点靠什么生效","id":"核心概念-自动埋点靠什么生效"},{"level":2,"text":"Java：agent jar 与 -javaagent 接入","id":"java-agent-jar-与-javaagent-接入"},{"level":2,"text":"Python 与 Node.js：预加载式接入","id":"python-与-node-js-预加载式接入"},{"level":2,"text":"Kubernetes 上的一键注入：Operator 与 Instrumentation CRD","id":"kubernetes-上的一键注入-operator-与-instrumentation-crd"},{"level":2,"text":"配置优先级与按库治理","id":"配置优先级与按库治理"},{"level":2,"text":"上线验证：三个必查项","id":"上线验证-三个必查项"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"头部采样与尾采样策略工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/observability-tracing-telemetry-platform/tracing-instrumentation-propagation/sampling-strategy-engineering"},"next":{"title":"遥测采集管道与 OpenTelemetry Collector 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/observability-tracing-telemetry-platform/telemetry-pipeline-storage-cost/collector-pipeline-architecture"}}